Bug 40248981 - mix the WAV recording for the Mongolian alveolar trill

Point addWav() at the WAV recording. The extensionless path points to
spectral data for FMT(). Update the mn and mn-f hashes for this snapshot.
Source: https://github.com/espeak-ng/espeak-ng/pull/2706

--- espeak-ng-1.53.0.20261103/phsource/ph_mongolian
+++ espeak-ng-1.53.0.20261103/phsource/ph_mongolian
@@ -297,11 +297,11 @@ phoneme r
   length 60
 
   IF nextPh(isVowel) THEN
-    FMT(r3/r_trill) addWav(r3/r_trill, 40)
+    FMT(r3/r_trill) addWav(r3/r_trill.wav, 40)
   ELIF prevPh(isVowel) AND nextPh(isNotVowel) THEN
-    FMT(r3/r_) addWav(r3/r_trill, 30)
+    FMT(r3/r_) addWav(r3/r_trill.wav, 30)
   ENDIF
-  FMT(r3/r_trill) addWav(r3/r_trill, 35)
+  FMT(r3/r_trill) addWav(r3/r_trill.wav, 35)
 endphoneme
 
 // x - voiceless velar fricative (most frequent Mongolian consonant)
